    <string name="def_guide_title">Can\'t see the choice?</string>
    <string name="def_guide_android">On Android TV: Settings &gt; Apps &gt; Default apps &gt; Home app &gt; ViktorychTV.</string>
    <string name="def_guide_google">Google TV hides the home app choice. It can only be changed from a computer with Android\'s free adb tool: turn on Developer options and USB or network debugging, run \"adb shell pm disable-user --user 0 com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\", then press Home and pick ViktorychTV. To undo it, run \"adb shell pm enable com.google.android.apps.tv.launcherx\".</string>
    <string name="def_guide_after">If the TV asks which home to use, pick ViktorychTV and choose Always.</string>
